    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>Drive Away the Goblins Invading the Town Not with Sermons, but with Lead Bullets!</u></strong><br><br>Use the modern firearms prepared at the facility to mow down the enemies!<br><br><strong>Game Overview:</strong><br>'Wurzelnsisters' is an action shooting game where the player controls Sister Nekono to protect the town from invading goblins. Sister Nekono uses various modern firearms to fend off the hordes of goblins.<br><br><u>Main Gameplay Elements:</u><br><br>Playable Character: Sister Nekono<br>Enemies: Hordes of goblins (lightweight and silent goblins, loud-footed orcs, goblins carrying bomb barrels)<br>Objective: Prevent the goblins from invading and protect the town<br>Firearms: Modern firearms prepared at the facility (rifles, shotguns, machine guns, etc.)<br><u>Game Features:</u><br><br>Strategic Shooting: Employ strategies to safely defeat enemies from a distance<br>Diverse Enemies: Multiple goblins with different behavior patterns and strengths<br>Area Defense: Defend specific areas while halting enemy advances<br>Resource Management: Manage ammunition and health packs effectively<br>Content:<br><br>Normal Mode: A mode where you repel goblins that have invaded the town.<br>Endless Mode: A mode where you challenge goblins until you are defeated.<br>No Item Mode: A game mode where no items exist outside of the church.<br><br>Enhancement features through points.<br>Unlock your favorite weapons.<br>Health enhancement features.",
